{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09403","headline":"始至郡 · 韦应物","name":"始至郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湓城古雄郡，横江千里驰。\n高树上迢递，峻堞绕欹危。\n井邑烟火晚，郊原草树滋。\n洪流荡北址，崇岭郁南圻。\n斯民本乐生，逃逝竟何爲。\n旱岁属荒歉，旧逋积如坻。\n到郡方逾月，终朝理乱丝。\n宾朋未及讌，简牍已云疲。\n昔贤播高风，得守愧无施。\n岂待干戈戢，且愿抚惸嫠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}